{"kind":"report","text":"Approved: exact repaired O2 head 1ceac10156f4ba66d4720bf66dbf160dcc82a052 on builder/own-agent-membership-20261102, tree 799cea28, for request 28b5cd84 under promise 8f601a58 and review request e12926bc. This approval covers the own-agent cohort, the two own-agent steps, their bounds and the enrollment client. It claims no consent page, no issuer composition, no deployment and no live host.\n\nItem 1 of 5cf22ef8 is resolved. invite-own-agent-key now carries two more Native guards:\n\n- own-agent-invitation-window requires inviteEnds after the entry's sequenced time (given.time) and at most 24 hours after it. A member therefore cannot hold an invitation open longer than a day.\n- own-agent-key-capacity pages through every invited and active key, 128 at a time. It refuses when any of them names this agent. Each agent therefore holds at most one live key through this path. With the eight-agent cap, one member holds at most eight live keys, against the room's 10,000.\n\nThe scenario covers a refusal 24 hours and one second out, a refusal at the act's own time, acceptance at exactly 24 hours, a refusal while the first invitation is pending and a refusal after enrollment. The active-key control and the 48-hour window control each fail at their intended assertion. The administrative invite-key path stays as it was.\n\nScope. Main ec48e2d5 is an ancestor, and the worktree is clean. The head changes 56 paths, and the commit-message check passes for all seven commits. The two new commits change only the Membership 13 guard source and its digest, the scenario, the owner seal, the rebuilt Page bundle, the docs and the evidence. Every other pin and declaration text stays exact. Card run 41571345366 and Page run 41570732480 succeeded at faa45ac2. From faa45ac2 to the head, only docs/cli.md, docs/mcp.md, the note and three manifests change, so the card inputs equal those of the runs.\n\nThe gate. gate.json records head faa45ac2 and tree 99640d87 before and after, with a clean status. gate.exit reads exit 0. The head adds only documents after that commit. Both earlier gates stay failed on the record, with the repairs I assessed in 5cf22ef8.\n\nEvidence. The eight manifests hold 129 files. The three new ones hash to c7ce7315…, a7391543… and a72f615a…, as the request states. Every file matches its size and digest and is read-only, and no unit holds an unlisted file. All 164 private raw references in the run records match their files. The scan for private keys, GitHub tokens and bearer values finds no match.\n\nArchitecture: sound. Both bounds are Native guards in Membership 13, beside the subset, controller and agent-capacity guards. HTTP and MCP grant nothing.\n\nSecurity: no blocking finding. An ordinary member can no longer fill the key table, and every invitation the member opens lapses within a day. The subset, controller and eight-agent rules hold as I found them in 5cf22ef8.\n\nSimplification: no required change. Two items for O3:\n\n1. The window leaves no margin. The page and CLI issuers write inviteEnds as their own clock plus exactly 24 hours (apps/room/page/src/data.ts:1422, packages/cli/src/invitations.ts:608). If O3 reuses either on this path, an issuer whose clock runs even a second ahead of the sequencer receives own-agent-invitation-window. Issue own-agent invitations with a lifetime below 24 hours, and add a case at that lifetime.\n2. After enrollment, a member cannot replace their agent's key alone. Only an admin or the recovery key can revoke it. The note says so. O3's consent page needs an answer for a lost connector: a new agent within the eight, or an admin's revoke.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:571ec614ce5333c165c97635259cf8b26ba5d3cc","binding":"assigned","head":"1ceac10156f4ba66d4720bf66dbf160dcc82a052","head_news_acknowledged":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:317c1a4d95dca041894a4301561e6dfd90937b78\"]","implementations":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:8f601a58d977510d5acc35aec7fc8cef69dfbd84\"]","review_frontier":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:51edb22d9f216867edf17a97f612513ad7d00640","review_path":"reviewguard@1","verdict":"approved"}}